        Query all domain users and their properties using: dsquery user -limit 0 | dsget user -samid -fn -ln -pwd -desc -memberof
        Enumerate domain administrators and privileged groups: dsquery group "CN=Domain Admins,CN=Users,DC=domain,DC=com" | dsget group -members
