      IDA Pro - Interactive disassembler and debugger
        Static binary analysis procedure: Load target binary, analyze functions/strings/imports, identify key algorithms and data structures, generate pseudocode using Hex-Rays decompiler
        Dynamic debugging workflow: Set breakpoints, analyze memory/registers, trace execution flow, modify values during runtime, analyze program behavior
        Malware analysis procedure: Identify obfuscation/packing, analyze anti-debugging techniques, extract C2 configurations, reveal encryption algorithms
        Vulnerability research process: Identify security functions, analyze input validation, locate memory operations, discover potential overflow conditions
        Patch binary files: Analyze assembly code, modify instructions/data, verify changes, create patched executable
        Script development workflow: Create IDAPython/IDC scripts for automation, implement custom analysis algorithms, extend IDA functionality
        Signature creation procedure: Analyze unique code patterns, generate YARA rules, create IDA FLIRT signatures for known functions
        Firmware analysis workflow: Load raw binary data, identify architecture/entry points, analyze bootloader/initialization code, map memory regions
        API hook analysis: Identify API calls, analyze hook implementations, trace function call chains, understand DLL interactions
        Cross-reference analysis: Track data/code references, analyze control flow, map function relationships, understand program structure
        Collaborative reverse engineering workflow: Share IDA database files, synchronize analysis with team members, merge multiple analysts' findings, document discoveries
        Advanced type reconstruction: Analyze complex data structures, recover C++ class hierarchies, rebuild vtables, document custom types
        Processor module development: Create custom processor definitions, implement instruction decoding, define register sets, handle special instructions
        Database management procedure: Create snapshot backups, merge partial analyses, export/import database segments, maintain version control
