        Visual data analysis using Amass visualization ('amass viz -d3 -d domain.com' to generate force-directed graphs)
        Database tracking and monitoring changes ('amass track -d domain.com' to monitor changes in findings over time)
        Intel gathering on specific ASNs and IP ranges ('amass intel -asn AS13337,AS14618 -ip 192.168.1.1-192.168.1.254')
        Certificate transparency monitoring ('amass enum -active -d domain.com -names -norecursive')
        Automated asset discovery pipeline ('amass enum -d domain.com -json output.json' integrated with other tools)
        DNS alterations and permutation scanning ('amass enum -alts -d domain.com')
        Organization mapping and relationship discovery ('amass intel -org "Target Company"')
        Zone transfer attempts and DNS record enumeration ('amass enum -active -d domain.com -axfr')
        Custom scripting with Amass APIs ('amass db -names -d domain.com | custom_script.py' for automated analysis)
        Rate-limited enumeration for stealth ('amass enum -d domain.com -max-dns-queries 100 -timeout 10')
        Targeted subdomain enumeration with scope restrictions ('amass enum -d domain.com -include-domains whitelist.txt')
        DNS record type specific enumeration ('amass enum -d domain.com -min-for-recursive 2 -types CNAME,MX,NS,A,AAAA')
        Geographic IP data collection ('amass intel -ip 192.168.1.1/24 -whois -d domain.com')
        Snapshot comparison for change detection ('amass db -snapshot NAME1 -d domain.com -diff NAME2')
        Local database manipulation ('amass db -show -d domain.com -enum -include-unresolvable')
        Cross-domain intelligence gathering ('amass intel -addr IP_RANGE -cidr CIDR_RANGE -asn ASN_LIST')
        Advanced DNS resolution configuration ('amass enum -d domain.com -resolvers custom_resolvers.txt -timeout-resolver 2')
        Domain categorization and filtering ('amass enum -d domain.com -exclude-domains blacklist.txt -include-domains whitelist.txt')
        Network infrastructure mapping ('amass enum -d domain.com -ipv4 -src -oA network_map')
        Automated reporting workflow ('amass enum -d domain.com -json | jq custom_filters > report.json')
        Distributed enumeration setup ('amass enum -d domain.com -share -config distributed_config.ini')
        Historical DNS data collection ('amass db -history -d domain.com -since "2023-01-01"')
        Custom wordlist generation ('amass enum -norecursive -d domain.com -w base_wordlist.txt -generate')
        Graph database integration ('amass db -graph -d domain.com | neo4j-import')
        DNS wildcard detection and handling ('amass enum -d domain.com -check-wildcard -noalts')
        Resource record pattern analysis ('amass intel -d domain.com -whois -src -demo')
        CIDR block correlation ('amass intel -cidr 192.168.0.0/16 -org "Target" -ip')
