    Reconnaissance/Scanning Tools - Tools for gathering information about targets
      Nmap - Network scanning and host discovery tool
        TCP SYN scan (-sS) with version detection (-sV) to identify running services while remaining relatively stealthy: nmap -sS -sV [target]
        Comprehensive vulnerability scanning using NSE scripts (-sC): nmap -sC [target]
        Operating system fingerprinting (-O) with aggressive timing (-T4): nmap -O -T4 [target]
        Stealth scanning with timing delays (-T2) and decoy IPs (-D): nmap -T2 -D RND:5 [target]
        UDP service discovery (-sU) on common ports: nmap -sU --top-ports 100 [target]
        Network sweep using ping scan (-sn) to identify live hosts: nmap -sn [target]/24
        Full port scan (-p-) with service enumeration: nmap -p- -sV [target]
        Firewall/IDS evasion using fragmented packets (-f): nmap -f -sS [target]
        Targeted scan of specific services (e.g., web, SMB): nmap -p 80,443,445 -sV [target]
        Automated vulnerability assessment using vuln NSE scripts: nmap --script vuln [target]
        SMB vulnerability scanning using specific NSE scripts: nmap --script smb-vuln* -p 445 [target]
        DNS enumeration and brute forcing: nmap --script dns-brute --script-args dns-brute.domain=[domain]
        Export results in multiple formats (-oA): nmap -oA [filename] [target]
        ACK scan (-sA) for firewall rule mapping: nmap -sA -p- [target]
        Banner grabbing with custom timing: nmap -sV --version-intensity 5 [target]
        IPv6 target scanning (-6): nmap -6 [target]
        Scan through proxy using ProxyChains: proxychains nmap -sT [target]
        Custom MTU size packet scanning: nmap --mtu 8 [target]
        SSL/TLS vulnerability scanning: nmap --script ssl-* -p 443 [target]
        Aggressive service detection with all NSE scripts: nmap -A [target]
        Authenticated scanning with credentials: nmap -sV --script +ssh-auth [target] --script-args ssh-auth.username=[user],ssh-auth.password=[pass]
        Web application scanning with HTTP scripts: nmap -p 80,443 --script http-* [target]
        Custom scan timing with specific packet rates: nmap --min-rate 100 --max-rate 500 [target]
        Scan through SOCKS proxy: nmap --proxy socks4://[proxy]:[port] [target]
        Script-based brute force attacks: nmap --script brute -p [ports] [target]
        Idle/Zombie scan using third-party host (-sI): nmap -sI [zombie] [target]
        FTP bounce attack scanning: nmap -b [ftp-server] [target]
        Custom source port scanning: nmap -g [port] [target]
        Network trace route with timing: nmap --traceroute --reason [target]
        Integration with Metasploit through XML output: nmap -sS -sV -oX [file] [target] for import to Metasploit
        MAC address spoofing: nmap --spoof-mac [MAC/Vendor] [target]
        Random data append to packets: nmap --data-length [size] [target]
        Custom IP options scanning: nmap --ip-options "R" [target]
        Scan with specific source IP: nmap -S [spoofed-ip] -e [interface] [target]
        Parallel host group scanning: nmap --min-hostgroup 50 --max-hostgroup 100 [target]
        Sequential port scanning: nmap --scan-delay 1s --max-retries 2 [target]
        Custom payload hex string: nmap --data 0xdeadbeef [target]
        Interface bandwidth utilization control: nmap --max-rate-host 100 [target]
        Custom TTL value scanning: nmap --ttl 60 [target]
        Advanced script debugging: nmap --script-trace --script [scriptname] [target]
