      Amass - Network mapping of attack surfaces
        Passive reconnaissance using intel gathering mode: amass intel -org [target_organization] -d [domain]
        Active DNS enumeration with default settings: amass enum -d [domain] -active -o [output_file]
        Comprehensive scan with multiple data sources: amass enum -d [domain] -active -brute -w [wordlist] -src
        Zone transfer attempts and ASN enumeration: amass enum -d [domain] -axfr -asn [ASN_numbers]
        Database integration for tracking changes: amass track -d [domain] -last 2 -config [config_file]
        Visualization of network relationships: amass viz -d3 -d [domain] -o [output_file]
        Custom configuration with API keys: Set up config.ini with API keys for Shodan, Censys, SecurityTrails
        Subdomain takeover scanning: amass enum -d [domain] -active -takeover
        Targeted infrastructure mapping: amass enum -d [domain] -cidr [IP_range] -active
        Automated periodic scanning: Schedule regular scans using cron jobs with different scan modes
        Rate-limited scanning for stealth: amass enum -d [domain] -max-dns-queries 100 -active
        Selective data source scanning: amass enum -d [domain] -active -include [source1,source2]
        Recursive enumeration of subdomains: amass enum -d [domain] -active -min-for-recursive 2
        Custom alterations and permutations: Configure alterations.txt with domain mutation rules
        Network graph generation: amass viz -maltego -d [domain] for Maltego integration
        DNS resolution validation: amass enum -d [domain] -active -resolve -ip
        Historical data collection: amass db -d [domain] -names -timeline
        Script integration using event output: amass enum -d [domain] -json -o [output.json]
        Cross-domain intelligence gathering: amass intel -whois -d [domain] -ip
        Local archive searching: amass db -show -d [domain] -names -since [date]
        Geographic location filtering: amass enum -d [domain] -geolocation -active -v
        Certificate transparency monitoring: amass enum -d [domain] -active -names -norecursive -include crtsh
        DNS brute forcing with custom parameters: amass enum -d [domain] -brute -min-for-recursive 3 -active -rf [resolvers.txt]
        Archive scanning integration: amass enum -d [domain] -active -include arquivo,archiveit,wayback
        DNS wildcard detection and handling: amass enum -d [domain] -active -check-wildcard -noalts
        External systems correlation: amass enum -d [domain] -active -include virustotal,alienvault,threatcrowd
        Reverse DNS sweeping: amass enum -d [domain] -active -rev -cidr [IP_range]
        Blacklist filtering implementation: Configure blacklist.txt for excluding specific subdomains/patterns
        Real-time monitoring setup: amass track -d [domain] with webhook notifications
        Database export for analysis: amass db -names -d [domain] -csv -o [output.csv]
