        Use custom resolver pools: Rotate through multiple resolver lists to avoid rate limiting
        Implement with domain frontings: Configure subfinder behind CDNs for evasion
        Create custom source templates: Add new sources using subfinder's template system
        Validate findings with SSL certificates: Combine with cert.sh and compare results
        Use with IP space mapping: Correlate subdomain findings with ASN information
        Implement custom filtering rules: Create rules based on organization naming patterns
        Set up distributed scanning: Run subfinder across multiple nodes for large scope
        Create custom wordlists from results: Generate targeted wordlists from discovered patterns
        Use historical scanning: Compare against Internet Archive for past subdomains
        Implement with OSINT correlation: Cross-reference findings with WHOIS and passive DNS data
