        Scan for vulnerable plugins and themes (wpscan --url [target] --api-token [token] --enumerate vp,vt) using WPScan vulnerability database
        Perform stealthy scanning with random delays (wpscan --url [target] --random-user-agent --throttle [ms]) to avoid detection
        Check for specific plugin versions and vulnerabilities (wpscan --url [target] --enumerate p --plugins-detection aggressive)
