      DNSenum - DNS enumeration script
        Use DNSenum with basic options to perform forward DNS lookups and zone transfers: dnsenum [domain] --noreverse
        Conduct brute force subdomain enumeration using built-in or custom wordlists: dnsenum [domain] -f [wordlist] --threads 10
