        Custom scan configuration: Modify config.toml file to adjust scanning parameters, timeouts, and tool selection
        Stealth scanning: Use '--profile stealth' option to reduce scan noise, implement delays between probes
        Service enumeration: Configure specific service scan options for HTTP, SMB, DNS, and other protocols
        Output management: Set custom output directory with '-o', organize scan results by target/service
        Scan resume: Use '--only-scans-dir' to continue interrupted scans from previous output directory
