        Random subdomain testing: dnsmap target.com -r true
        Combine with wildcard DNS detection: dnsmap target.com -w /path/to/wordlist.txt --wildcard-detect
        Use multiple wordlists simultaneously: dnsmap target.com -w list1.txt,list2.txt,list3.txt
        Target specific DNS servers: dnsmap target.com --dns-server 8.8.8.8
        Perform bruteforce with numeric ranges: dnsmap target.com --numeric 1-100
        Export results in XML format: dnsmap target.com --xml-output results.xml
        Recursive subdomain scanning: dnsmap target.com --recursive
        Filter results by IP range: dnsmap target.com --filter-range 10.0.0.0/8
        Use custom DNS timeout: dnsmap target.com --timeout 3
        Pipeline with DNS zone transfer attempts: dnsmap target.com --attempt-zone-transfer
        Use custom user-agent string: dnsmap target.com --user-agent "CustomAgent/1.0"
        Integrate with proxy for anonymity: dnsmap target.com --proxy socks5://127.0.0.1:9050
        Generate permutation-based wordlist: dnsmap target.com --generate-permutations
        Perform reverse lookup validation: dnsmap target.com --validate-reverse
        Debug mode for detailed output: dnsmap target.com --debug
        Export results for Maltego integration: dnsmap target.com --maltego-output
