        Integration with incident response: Deploy AVML as part of automated IR playbooks to collect memory during security incidents
        Forensic analysis preparation: Capture memory with AVML, convert output to standard formats for analysis in other forensic tools
        Live system analysis: Use AVML to capture memory while minimizing system impact and maintaining evidence integrity
        Cloud instance memory acquisition: Deploy AVML in cloud environments to capture memory from Linux-based virtual machines
