      ParamSpider - Parameter discovery for web applications
        Scan web application using archived URLs from Wayback Machine with command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com --subs True -w
        Extract parameters from custom wordlist using command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com -l custom_wordlist.txt
        Perform recursive crawling with command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com --level 3
        Output results in JSON format for integration with other tools using command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com --output json
        Exclude specific file extensions using command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com --exclude php,jpg,svg
        Use proxy settings for anonymous scanning with command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com --proxy http://127.0.0.1:8080
        Scan specific endpoints using command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com --endpoints /api/,/admin/
        Filter output for specific parameter patterns using grep with command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com | grep -E "id=|key="
        Generate sitemap of discovered parameters using command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com --sitemap True
        Combine with XSS testing by piping output to tools like XSStrike: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com | python3 xsstrike.py
        Implement rate limiting to avoid detection using command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com --delay 2
        Use custom headers for scanning with command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com --headers "User-Agent: Custom"
        Combine with GF patterns for sensitive parameter discovery: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com | gf xss
        Process output with custom regex patterns using command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com | grep -E "(key|token|password)="
        Generate parameter wordlist from output using command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com | cut -d "=" -f1 | sort -u
        Scan multiple domains from file using command: python3 paramspider.py --domain-list domains.txt
        Use threading for faster scanning with command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com --threads 20
        Filter live parameters using httpx: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com | httpx -silent
        Export results to Burp Suite using command: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com --output burp
        Combine with nuclei templates for vulnerability scanning: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com | nuclei -t nuclei-templates/
        Chain with waybackurls for comprehensive parameter discovery: cat domains.txt | waybackurls | python3 paramspider.py --input -
        Use ParamSpider with subfinder for subdomain parameter discovery: subfinder -d target.com | python3 paramspider.py --input -
        Filter sensitive parameters for SSRF testing: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com | grep -E "(url|redirect|link)="
        Create custom parameter mutation list: python3 paramspider.py -d target.com | awk -F "=" '{print $1}' | anew params.txt
        Automate daily scans using cron: 0 0 * * * python3 /path/to/paramspider.py -d target.com --output daily_scan.txt
