        Password/PIN bypass procedure: Utilize UFED's unlock tools and exploits to bypass device security, screen locks, and encryption
        Cloud data extraction procedure: Extract cloud-based backups and synced data using device tokens or credentials
        App data analysis procedure: Extract and decode application databases, cache files, and stored credentials from installed apps
        Timeline analysis procedure: Create activity timeline from extracted data, correlate events across different data sources
        Advanced data recovery procedure: Recover deleted messages, photos, and files using specialized recovery algorithms
        Report generation procedure: Compile extracted data into forensic reports with timestamps, file hashes, and chain of custody
        Real-time extraction procedure: Monitor and capture live device data, including network traffic and system activities
        SIM card extraction procedure: Extract subscriber information, contacts, SMS messages, and network data using SIM card reader
        Memory card extraction procedure: Mount and analyze external storage media, recover deleted files, and create forensic images
        Cross-device data correlation procedure: Link data between multiple devices, identify communication patterns and shared content
        Custom extraction script procedure: Develop and deploy Python scripts for automated data extraction and parsing
        Bootloader exploitation procedure: Utilize bootloader vulnerabilities to bypass security measures and extract protected data
        Wireless extraction procedure: Perform extraction over Bluetooth or Wi-Fi when physical connection isn't possible
        Advanced decryption procedure: Decrypt secured communications, encrypted files, and protected app data
        GPS/location data extraction procedure: Extract and map location history, geotags, and cached location data
        Social media app extraction procedure: Extract data from social media apps including deleted messages and media
        Database reconstruction procedure: Rebuild and analyze SQLite databases from extracted app data
        Device clone/backup procedure: Create exact device duplicates for analysis while preserving original evidence
        Malware/spyware detection procedure: Scan extracted data for indicators of malicious software or surveillance tools
        EDL (Emergency Download) mode procedure: Force Qualcomm devices into EDL mode for deep extraction
        Device triage procedure: Rapidly assess device content and prioritize data extraction based on case requirements
        Verification/validation procedure: Verify hash values and validate extracted data integrity for evidence admissibility
        Multi-factor authentication bypass procedure: Circumvent 2FA and additional security layers using token extraction
        Custom parser development procedure: Create custom parsers for unsupported apps or new data formats
        Remote acquisition procedure: Set up and perform remote extractions using UFED Link Analysis
        Brute force procedure: Execute systematic password/pattern attempts using UFED's built-in cracking capabilities
        Device isolation procedure: Implement Faraday isolation and cellular blocking during extraction
