      de4dot - .NET deobfuscator
        Use de4dot to automatically detect and remove Dotfuscator obfuscation through command: de4dot.exe --detect target.exe
        Remove string encryption and control flow obfuscation with command: de4dot.exe -r target.exe
        Deobfuscate multiple assemblies recursively using wildcards: de4dot.exe -r *.exe *.dll
        Force specific deobfuscator type using -p switch: de4dot.exe -p un target.exe
        Preserve tokens during deobfuscation: de4dot.exe --preserve-tokens target.exe
        Extract embedded assemblies from obfuscated code: de4dot.exe --un-embed target.exe
        Rename obfuscated symbols to readable names: de4dot.exe --rename target.exe
        Process assembly in single-thread mode for debugging: de4dot.exe --single-thread target.exe
        Save deobfuscated output with custom name: de4dot.exe -o deobfuscated.exe target.exe
        Generate symbol map file during deobfuscation: de4dot.exe --symbol-map symbols.map target.exe
        Dump all types and methods information: de4dot.exe --dump-all target.exe
        Handle mixed-mode assemblies with native code: de4dot.exe --dont-rename-native target.exe
        Keep obfuscated names when deobfuscation fails: de4dot.exe --keep-names target.exe
        Process ConfuserEx protected assemblies with specific options: de4dot.exe --un-confuser target.exe
        Handle SmartAssembly obfuscation: de4dot.exe --smart-assembly target.exe
        Deobfuscate Dotfuscator with additional parameters: de4dot.exe --dotfuscator --preserve-md target.exe
        Process assemblies with strong name signatures: de4dot.exe --sstrong-name-remove target.exe
        Create backup of original files before deobfuscation: de4dot.exe --backup target.exe
        Handle Babel.NET obfuscated assemblies: de4dot.exe --un-babel target.exe
        Generate detailed deobfuscation log: de4dot.exe --verbose --log-file debug.log target.exe
        Handle virtualized .NET code: de4dot.exe --un-virtualize target.exe
        Process assemblies with invalid metadata: de4dot.exe --ignore-bad-md target.exe
        Integrate with dnSpy for immediate analysis: de4dot.exe --dont-create-params --preserve-tokens target.exe && dnspy deobfuscated.exe
        Handle Eazfuscator.NET protected assemblies: de4dot.exe --un-eazfuscator target.exe
        Process assemblies with encrypted resources: de4dot.exe --decrypt-resources target.exe
        Handle assemblies with custom attributes preservation: de4dot.exe --preserve-attrs target.exe
        Process assemblies with proxy calls: de4dot.exe --un-proxy target.exe
        Handle assemblies with compressed contents: de4dot.exe --un-compress target.exe
        Deobfuscate with regex pattern matching: de4dot.exe --regex-pattern "pattern" target.exe
        Process assemblies with anti-tamper protection: de4dot.exe --remove-protection target.exe
        Handle assemblies with mixed obfuscation layers: de4dot.exe --un-mix --keep-failed target.exe
        Process assemblies with runtime hooks: de4dot.exe --remove-runtime-hooks target.exe
        Handle assemblies with dynamic code emission: de4dot.exe --preserve-dynamic target.exe
        Process assemblies with fake obfuscation: de4dot.exe --ignore-fake target.exe
        Integrate with ILSpy for immediate decompilation: de4dot.exe target.exe && ilspy deobfuscated.exe
        Handle assemblies with method mutation: de4dot.exe --un-mutate target.exe
        Process assemblies with stack trace obfuscation: de4dot.exe --fix-stack-trace target.exe
        Handle assemblies with reflection obfuscation: de4dot.exe --un-reflect target.exe
        Generate assembly difference report: de4dot.exe --diff-original target.exe
        Process assemblies with delegate obfuscation: de4dot.exe --un-delegate target.exe
