        Sign repackaged app with counterfeit or stolen certificates
        Create convincing app store listings with similar names, icons, and descriptions
        Compromise third-party app store infrastructure through known vulnerabilities
        Upload repackaged malicious apps to compromised or less-secured app stores
        Use SEO techniques to improve visibility of malicious app listings
        Set up command and control infrastructure for deployed malware
