        - Implement irreversible disk encryption
        - Prevent system recovery
        Network propagation mechanisms:
        - Scan internal networks for vulnerable SMB services
        - Utilize WMIC for remote execution
        - Exploit ETERNALROMANCE as backup spreader
        - Target specific network ports (139, 445)
        - Create scheduled tasks for execution
        Anti-analysis and evasion techniques:
        - Check for virtual machine indicators
        - Implement anti-debugging mechanisms
        - Use XOR encryption for payload obfuscation
        - Delete event logs and backup catalogs
